       _u_d_i_a_g___f_a_m_i_l_y
              This field has the same meaning as in _s_t_r_u_c_t _u_n_i_x___d_i_a_g___r_e_q.

       _u_d_i_a_g___t_y_p_e
              This  is  set  to  one of SSOOCCKK__PPAACCKKEETT, SSOOCCKK__SSTTRREEAAMM, or SSOOCCKK__SSEEQQ‐‐
              PPAACCKKEETT.

       _u_d_i_a_g___s_t_a_t_e
