       _p_a_d    This field is set to 0.

       _u_d_i_a_g___i_n_o
              This is the socket inode number.

       _u_d_i_a_g___c_o_o_k_i_e
              This is an array of opaque identifiers that  could  be  used  in
              subsequent queries.

